# reference directory, which does not exist on Kaggle, so scripts 01 and 02
# could not otherwise run there. See MIGRATION_NOTES.md section 13.4.
!artifacts/dev_split.json
# the audit trail for the 27 excluded images -- small, and quoted in the paper
